      "path": "src/environments/endurance/agensh-workload.js",
      "line": 33,
      "expression": "return `HOUR_STAGE_${stage}_${peer.key}: Work only on your own WORK_BRANCH. On stage 0 clone RUN_REPOSITORY into the empty project root and create WORK_BRANCH; later stages reuse this exact checkout. Create ${path} with JSON {\"peer\":\"${peer.key}\",\"stage\":${stage},\"n\":${n},\"square\":${n * n}} and exactly one trailing newline. Check its bytes, commit and push. Publish one admitted FACT with content ${fact} through swarm agensh-context board_write {board_id:RUN_BOARD,type:\"FACT\",content:\"${fact}\"}. Never send unsolicited messages or comments. At stage 4, create one real PR from WORK_BRANCH to main through swarm gitea pull_request_write after push, and finish briefly. ${peer.key === 'b' && stage === 4 ? 'Before writing, use actual authenticated Git/Gitea to read hour-a-4.json from main (A has already stopped), parse the original square, and add adoptedSquare and sum to your JSON: adoptedSquare is the read value, sum is your square plus that value. Preserve all other files.' : ''} Board write fields are board_id,type,content; PR create fields are owner,repo,method:\"create\",title,head:WORK_BRANCH,base:\"main\". Use the existing Service schemas and Bash CLI; do not fabricate acknowledgements, addresses or SHAs. Stop the turn after these finite operations.${stage === 0 ? '' : program.prompt(index, stage)}`;"
    },
